{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"الدرس 2. الكلمات الجديدة: he، was، do، it، for، have، be، me، this، she."},{"btype":"example","text":"he = هو","note":"مثال: He is French. — إنه فرنسي."},{"btype":"example","text":"was = كان (الماضي من be)","note":"مثال: It was in April. — كان ذلك في شهر أفريل."},{"btype":"example","text":"do = يفعل؛ أداة السؤال والنفي","note":"مثال: Do this for me. — قم بذلك من أجلي."},{"btype":"example","text":"it = هو، هي (لغير العاقل)","note":"مثال: It was in April. — كان ذلك في شهر أفريل."},{"btype":"example","text":"for = لِـ، من أجل","note":"مثال: Do this for me. — قم بذلك من أجلي."},{"btype":"example","text":"have = يملك، عنده","note":""},{"btype":"example","text":"be = يكون","note":""},{"btype":"example","text":"me = ـني، ـي (ضمير المتكلّم المفعول)","note":"مثال: Do this for me. — قم بذلك من أجلي."},{"btype":"example","text":"this = هذا، هذه","note":"مثال: Do this for me. — قم بذلك من أجلي."},{"btype":"example","text":"she = هي","note":""},{"btype":"text","text":"قاعدة: الماضي البسيط"},{"btype":"text","text":"الأفعال المنتظمة تأخذ ‎-ed‎: worked، played. والشاذّة تُحفظ: go ← went، see ← saw، say ← said، have ← had."},{"btype":"text","text":"السؤال والنفي بـ did ويعود الفعل إلى أصله: Did you see him? / I didn't go."},{"btype":"example","text":"I went home.","note":"ذهبت إلى البيت."},{"btype":"example","text":"Did you sleep well?","note":"هل نمت جيّدًا؟"},{"btype":"text","text":"قاعدة: السؤال والنفي بـ do / does"},{"btype":"text","text":"للسؤال والنفي في المضارع البسيط يُستعمل do (وdoes مع he/she/it): Do you speak English? / He doesn't know."},{"btype":"text","text":"مع does يعود الفعل إلى أصله بلا s: Does she work? لا Does she works?"},{"btype":"example","text":"Do you like tea?","note":"هل تحبّ الشاي؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"I don't understand.","note":"لا أفهم."},{"btype":"text","text":"جمل الدرس:"},{"btype":"example","text":"Do this for me.","note":"قم بذلك من أجلي."},{"btype":"example","text":"It was in April.","note":"كان ذلك في شهر أفريل."},{"btype":"example","text":"This is for you.","note":"هذا لك."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri was OK.","note":"كان زيري بخير."},{"btype":"example","text":"He is French.","note":"إنه فرنسي."},{"btype":"example","text":"Is this Ziri?","note":"هل هذا زيري؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"This is Ziri.","note":"هذا زيري."},{"btype":"example","text":"Mennad was OK.","note":"كان منّاد على ما يرام."},{"btype":"example","text":"That was Ziri.","note":"كان ذلك زيري."},{"btype":"example","text":"It is Chinese.","note":"هذه صينيّة."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":5,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.write","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.listen","count":2,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.truefalse","count":2,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Do this for me.","ar":"قم بذلك من أجلي."},{"t":"It was in April.","ar":"كان ذلك في شهر أفريل."},{"t":"This is for you.","ar":"هذا لك."},{"t":"Ziri was OK.","ar":"كان زيري بخير."},{"t":"He is French.","ar":"إنه فرنسي."},{"t":"Is this Ziri?","ar":"هل هذا زيري؟"},{"t":"This is Ziri.","ar":"هذا زيري."},{"t":"Mennad was OK.","ar":"كان منّاد على م